            "solution": "Cho cấp số cộng $(u_n)$ có $u_{3}=28,u_{7}=68$. Tính $u_{27}$.\n\nLời giải:\n $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n    u_{3}=28 \\\\ \n    u_{7}=68 \n    \\end{array} \\right.$$\\Rightarrow\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n    u_1 +2d=28 \\\\ \n    u_1+6d=68\n    \\end{array} \\right.$$\\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n    u_1=8 \\\\ \n    d=10\n    \\end{array} \\right.$\n\n$u_{27}=8 +26.10=268$.\n\nĐáp án: 268 \n\n"
