            "correctAnswer": "-27",
            "solution": "Cho cấp số cộng $(u_n)$ thỏa mãn $4u_3-6u_4=158$ và $-7u_7+u_2=617$. Tính tổng $u_1+d$.\n\nLời giải:\n $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n    4u_3-6u_4=158 \\\\ \n    -7u_7+u_2=617\n    \\end{array} \\right.$$\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n        4u_3-6u_4=158 \\\\ \n        -7u_7+u_2=617\n        \\end{array} \\right.$$\\Leftrightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n    4(u_1+2d)-6(u_1+3d)=158 \\\\ \n    -7(u_1+6d)+(u_1+1d)=617\n    \\end{array} \\right.$\n\n$\\Leftrightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n        -2u_1-10d=130 \\\\ \n        -6u_1-41d=533\n        \\end{array} \\right.$$\\Leftrightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \n        u_1=-14 \\\\ \n        d=-13\n        \\end{array} \\right.$\n\n$u_1+d=-27$ \nĐáp án: -27\n\n"
