            "correctAnswer": "-1,0",
            "solution": "Cho hai vectơ $\\overrightarrow{u}$ và $\\overrightarrow{v}$ thỏa mãn $|\\overrightarrow{u}|=5,|\\overrightarrow{v}|=4$ và $\\overrightarrow{u}.\\overrightarrow{v}=-20$. Xét hai vectơ $\\overrightarrow{x}=-2\\overrightarrow{u}-3\\overrightarrow{v}$ và $\\overrightarrow{y}=-3\\overrightarrow{u}-\\overrightarrow{v}$. Tính $\\cos(\\overrightarrow{x},\\overrightarrow{y})$ (kết quả làm tròn đến hàng phần mười).\n\nLời giải:\n $\\overrightarrow{x}.\\overrightarrow{y}=(-2\\overrightarrow{u}-3\\overrightarrow{v}).(-3\\overrightarrow{u}-\\overrightarrow{v})=6\\overrightarrow{u}^2+3\\overrightarrow{v}^2+1\\overrightarrow{u}.\\overrightarrow{v}=6.5^2+3.4^2+11.(-20)=-22$.\n\n$|\\overrightarrow{x}|=\\sqrt{\\overrightarrow{x}^2}=\\sqrt{(-2\\overrightarrow{u}-3\\overrightarrow{v})^2}=\\sqrt{4\\overrightarrow{u}^2+9\\overrightarrow{v}^2+12.\\overrightarrow{u}.\\overrightarrow{v}}=\\sqrt{4.5^2+9.4^2+12.(-20)}=2$.\n\n$|\\overrightarrow{y}|=\\sqrt{\\overrightarrow{y}^2}=\\sqrt{(-3\\overrightarrow{u}-\\overrightarrow{v})^2}=\\sqrt{9\\overrightarrow{u}^2+\\overrightarrow{v}^2+6.\\overrightarrow{u}.\\overrightarrow{v}}=\\sqrt{9.5^2+1.4^2+6.(-20)}=11$.\n\n$\\cos(\\overrightarrow{x},\\overrightarrow{y})=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{x}.\\overrightarrow{y}}{|\\overrightarrow{x}|.|\\overrightarrow{y}|}=\\dfrac{-22}{2.11}\\approx -1,0$\n\nĐáp án: -1,0 \n\n"
